## Non-negotiables

- Softree positioning: **AI Transformation Partner** — outcomes over features (see `brand-positioning.md`).
- Never sacrifice accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA) or working build for visual polish.
- No dark patterns: no fake urgency/countdowns, no deceptive CTAs.
- Research live references with screenshots this session — do not rely on training data.
- After any change, verify build + render before moving on.
- Verifier loop required — builder never self-approves (see master prompt Complete Loop).
- Log every change as: [agent] changed X because Y, trade-off: Z.

## Page-specific constraints

- Embed or deep-link the existing AI analyser (`/webanalyser` → `web-lead-magnet-seven.vercel.app`); hero URL input must prefill the tool.
- Reuse Kore interaction patterns (scroll reveals, pinned sections, radar/trust viz) from `src/components/softree-agentic-exact/` — do not copy competitor branding verbatim.
- Preserve site shell: `NavigationClient`, `LightContactSection`, `Footer` unless Brief says otherwise.
- Wireframe/competitor outputs may be gated behind email — never fake a generated result; use labelled sample/demo data where the backend is not ready.

